<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in active trade.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 47.33 to 6877.74. For the week, the Dow fell 53.88 points.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.38 to 415.51.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.25.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1454 to 1027.</p>
<p>Volume was 508,266,000 compared with 464,677,570 on Thursday. Weekly volume totalled 2,554,076,000 shares.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2045 GMT).</p>
